# Leaves a book part-read, so a later pair run has two devices at genuinely unrelated positions --
# the divergent join of docs/pageflip.md section 4.3. Run solo: with no peer there is no spread and
# no join, just an ordinary reader saving its progress on the way out.
log pageflip-seed: start
expect_timeout 60000
expect Entering activity: Home
wait 800
tap confirm
expect Entering activity: EpubReader
# First open builds the section cache.
wait 9000
tap down
wait 2500
tap down
wait 3000
log pageflip-seed: done
quit
